{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":62,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["锡安蒙主喜悦"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["为了锡安我不再缄默，",{"text":"为了耶路撒冷我不再沉默，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到她的公义如明光照耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的救恩如燃烧的火把。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列国必看见你的公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列王必看见你的荣耀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华必亲口赐你一个新名字。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必成为耶和华手中的华冠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你上帝手上的荣冕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不再被称为“弃妇”，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的土地不再被称为“荒凉之地”。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要被称为“主所喜悦的”，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的土地要被称为“有夫之妇”，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为耶和华必喜爱你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做你土地的丈夫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的人民必娶你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像少男娶少女；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上帝必喜爱你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同新郎喜爱新娘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶路撒冷啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已在你城墙上设立守望者。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们昼夜不停地祷告。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呼求耶和华的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们不可歇息，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要常常敦促祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到祂建立耶路撒冷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使耶路撒冷得到普世的赞美。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华凭祂的右手，凭祂大能的臂膀起誓说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我再也不会把你的五谷给你的仇敌吃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不会让外族人喝你辛苦酿制的新酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收割的人必享受五谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赞美耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"摘葡萄的人必在我圣所的院内喝酒。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们要出去，去城外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为百姓修平道路。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要修筑，修筑大道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"清除石头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为万民竖立旗帜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，耶和华已经向普世宣告：“要对少女锡安说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘看啊，你的拯救者带着奖赏和报酬来了！’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们将被称为圣民，是耶和华救赎的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你将被称为蒙眷爱、不再被撇弃的城。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/62.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/63.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/61.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}